If a patient has a single-modality-therapy-nonresponse then every clinician should consider a multimodal-therapy for the patient.
Every clinician should individualize a multimodal-therapy with a patient-need.
Every clinician should individualize a multimodal-therapy with a treatment-cost.
Every clinician should individualize a multimodal-therapy with a treatment-convenience.
Every clinician should individualize a multimodal-therapy with an individual-factor.
